on"}, {"id": "5d828d98-e237-4556-85ec-256ac6838335", "type": "concept", "title": "Total landed cost"}], "description": "Gist: Location decisions balance demand, labor, tariffs, infrastructure, risk, skills, and proximity."}, {"id": "2716cbda-93cc-4b4d-9651-3a848401846a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Network modeling", "children": [{"id": "d51ab0c8-e033-4b60-859b-cf1c9487a0f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Facility location"}, {"id": "529c500f-d489-4504-8204-d1172f5fbe77", "type": "concept", "title": "Scenario analysis"}, {"id": "72065447-0078-42d9-a69d-9209b8c4647d", "type": "concept", "title": "Optimization"}, {"id": "6e4eddf3-93b1-4e2f-b4f1-64161e90b37d", "type": "concept", "title": "Sensitivity testing"}], "description": "Gist: Students learn how models translate strategy into location, capacity, and flow choices."}]}, {"id": "73782a0b-837b-4f9d-b3bb-e61d6b5dfaee", "type": "topic", "title": "Global Trade, Geopolitics, and Regulatory Environment", "description": "Understand how trade rules, customs, sanctions, tariffs, geopolitics, and institutions shape global supply-chain decisions.", "children": [{"id": "6e6174fa-d197-4335-afaf-93134dc4223a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Trade mechanics", "children": [{"id": "c75b4a91-ce52-4e32-b60c-9d67872eea10", "type": "concept", "title": "Incoterms"}, {"id": "7c95a10c-856c-450b-a48e-69c4984a8b94", "type": "concept", "title": "Customs clearance"}, {"id": "6da8442d-94a8-4cd4-91b3-9b02f19410bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Harmonized codes"}, {"id": "54aa84ab-a22e-4f62-aef9-452c751179c8", "type": "concept", "title": "Rules of origin"}], "description": "Gist: Global supply chains require literacy in customs, documentation, duties, and trade terms."}, {"id": "c4820870-25c6-405c-8247-9c4a92edc6b8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Geopolitical risk", "children": [{"id": "c6990c03-9816-45ff-b181-f172591c93ac", "type": "concept", "title": "Tariffs"}, {"id": "43280ceb-7acf-4e56-a00e-ebd25ac5082c", "type": "concept", "title": "Sanctions"}, {"id": "07ca0b24-e505-4334-95f1-783c75713f0c", "type": "concept", "title": "Export controls"}, {"id": "cd8c7b77-4c88-407b-9f71-10871be693c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Friend-shoring"}], "description": "Gist: Political conflict, sanctions, export controls, and industrial policy can reshape networks quickly."}, {"id": "5cfa5d2b-3467-4759-9c36-a05dde4fcdb7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Institutional context", "children": [{"id": "bfbb5e89-14bf-416e-a8d5-9f4996f101b3", "type": "concept", "title": "World Bank LPI"}, {"id": "d19b25b5-dc15-4d69-8d30-9afc0e838338", "type": "concept", "title": "Port performance"}, {"id": "c9ec7215-cc3e-4caf-8f07-3321f9e2b160", "type": "concept", "title": "Trade agreements"}, {"id": "cd33c306-a2f0-473e-a7f3-b565aca01f4a", "type": "concept", "title": "Regulatory quality"}], "description": "Gist: Students connect country performance and infrastructure to logistics feasibility."}]}, {"id": "0207fa97-9277-47c7-a8f3-6d865e6522d9", "type": "topic", "title": "Demand Planning, Forecasting, and S&OP", "description": "Build the planning foundation for matching demand, supply, inventory, capacity, and financial targets.", "children": [{"id": "3ec532bb-d99e-47bc-90ee-912318ee0638", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Forecasting basics", "children": [{"id": "6a371fad-2073-495e-875d-8733f588b4d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Time series"}, {"id": "27de9a5d-7538-4889-a79b-22f1928eb987", "type": "concept", "title": "Causal drivers"}, {"id": "c6f97877-4127-42cb-b666-8b31c7a24063", "type": "concept", "title": "Forecast error"}, {"id": "5784e0a3-3848-49f8-8ffd-ef14cb67fb0e", "type": "concept", "title": "Bias"}], "description": "Gist: Forecasts are imperfect but essential for capacity, inventory, procurement, and financial plans."}, {"id": "20837c28-c6aa-452b-ba2f-85a1e484e13b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Demand and supply balancing", "children": [{"id": "a160385d-05ef-45cc-9e8c-1f529bd65a74", "type": "concept", "title": "Consensus forecast"}, {"id": "4e84db03-6a75-420b-b9fa-c2abd3862a62", "type": "concept", "title": "Supply review"}, {"id": "40aa2ba0-9dbb-4e9f-89e6-d7be40edef39", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive S&OP"}, {"id": "a257e3f5-402e-460f-89d3-89132461ed50", "type": "concept", "title": "IBP"}], "description": "Gist: S&OP translates market demand into feasible supply, inventory, and financial choices."}, {"id": "6bab6a7e-a92b-42d7-8664-8360e21823c3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Planning hierarchy", "children": [{"id": "5014c94e-d338-41c8-aec8-844b2daf3e26", "type": "concept", "title": "Aggregate planning"}, {"id": "70a3e954-e01b-4b95-9478-a7c72fa47403", "type": "concept", "title": "Master scheduling"}, {"id": "76d182bd-59d3-45e4-9447-737d662f9beb", "type": "concept", "title": "MRP"}, {"id": "86466ae4-c467-4c59-afdb-eafa843b1c3c", "type": "concept", "title": "Exception management"}], "description": "Gist: Students learn how strategic, tactical, and operational plans connect."}]}, {"id": "127a8c93-49fc-434d-9498-673eb58f6848", "type": "topic", "title": "Inventory, Service Levels, and Working Capital", "description": "Analyze inventory tradeoffs across uncertainty, service, cost, cash, and resilience.", "children": [{"id": "819d2319-c625-4110-b940-33bc2023cadc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Inventory roles", "children": [{"id": "3f27c988-e94b-4fc5-b36e-0b3856248120", "type": "concept", "title": "Cycle stock"}, {"id": "862b7cb6-64c9-49cf-b8e0-1419dcf93d18", "type": "concept", "title": "Safety stock"}, {"id": "7ecde2af-7ad9-4f46-a185-4077d426e388", "type": "concept", "title": "Pipeline inventory"}, {"id": "6cd2c247-e41f-4630-8c4e-3cbc97fc2cdd", "type": "concept", "title": "Decoupling stock"}], "description": "Gist: Inventory buffers uncertainty but ties up cash and can hide process problems."}, {"id": "b30bb668-fa78-4f79-a972-2d585bb1de92", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Service and uncertainty", "children": [{"id": "24abb70f-3989-41dd-a9fa-11781559c90a", "type": "concept", "title": "EOQ"}, {"id": "b